<title>USA: Pilgrim America Capital board oks buyback.</title>
<headline>Pilgrim America Capital board oks buyback.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilgrim America Capital Corp said Wednesday its board approved the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares of its common stock from time to time in open market transactions.</p>
<p>The company said it will use its cash or borrowed funds under its existing line of credit to acquire the shares, and it will return the shares to its treasury, reducing the number of shares outstanding from 3,866,130.</p>
</text>
